@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001
@token = 登录后把响应中的token粘贴到这里
@meetingId = 1
@draftId = 1
@taskId = 1

### 健康检查
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### 组长登录
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "zhangsan@example.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 当前用户
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 团队成员
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/team/members
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 新建会议
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/meetings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "接口联调会议",
  "date": "2026-09-08",
  "content": "下周三前，小王整理实验数据，小李完成展示PPT，大家周五讨论测试结果。"
}

### AI 提取（把上一步响应ID填入 meetingId）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/extract
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "meetingId": {{meetingId}}
}

### 查询最近草稿
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/drafts?meetingId={{meetingId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 人工修正草稿
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/drafts/{{draftId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "组织测试结果讨论",
  "assignee": "张三",
  "deadline": "2026-09-11",
  "priority": "中",
  "sourceText": "大家周五讨论测试结果"
}

### 确认草稿
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "draftId": {{draftId}}
}

### 团队任务
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 更新任务
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "进行中",
  "progressPercent": 50
}

### 统计
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/statistics
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### AI 提取记录
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/extractions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 审计日志
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/audit-logs?limit=100
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

